VEYLENTRA — COMPLETE STUDENT, FACULTY & APP EXPERIENCE UPGRADE

PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

The recently completed Student and Faculty upgrades are not good enough yet. The current experience is difficult to understand, lacks meaningful visual guidance, feels feature-limited, and does not deliver the quality expected from a modern educational platform.

I want you to rethink, improve, and substantially upgrade the entire Veylentra experience.

This is not a request to add a few dashboard cards, decorative elements, or superficial features. I want Veylentra to become a polished, intuitive, feature-rich educational application that students and faculty can use comfortably every day.

The final experience should feel like a carefully designed desktop and mobile application—not a conventional website with pages, generic cards, and unnecessary borders.

You have creative freedom to improve the experience, information architecture, navigation, interactions, visual hierarchy, and feature set. However, you must preserve Veylentra's identity, working functionality, existing design language, and established architecture.

